[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0923","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0923.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1077","title":"Apple Mac OS 9 空闲锁定绕过漏洞","description":"Mac OS 9 的空闲锁定功能存在安全漏洞，本地攻击者可通过程序员开关或 CMD-PWR 键盘组合键调出调试器，利用调试器禁用屏幕锁定，从而绕过密码保护获取未授权访问权限。攻击者需要物理接触目标系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1077"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-11-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级至 Mac OS X 或更高版本操作系统，或物理禁用程序员开关以防止调试器被未授权调用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T22:35:01Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94149318124548&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/756"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0923.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0024","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0354","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 与 Word 97 模板 Visual Basic 任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 4.x/5.x 与 Word 97 集成时存在安全漏洞。当用户通过 IE 浏览包含恶意 Word 97 模板的网页时，浏览器不会对模板中内嵌的可执行 Visual Basic 代码发出安全警告，导致攻击者可在用户 IE 客户端上下文中执行任意 VBA 程序。该漏洞也影响 Microsoft Outlook 客户端，当用户预览或打开包含恶意 Word 模板附件的邮件时同样会触发。攻击者可通过构造特制的 Word 文档或 HTML 邮件诱使用户打开，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码，完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0354"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-11-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 提供的安全公告 MS99-002 对应补丁程序，该补丁可在文档基于含宏的模板启动时弹出安全警告。同时建议在 Word 中将宏安全级别设置为「高」或「禁用所有宏并发出通知」，并避免打开来自不受信任来源的 Office 文档。对于 Outlook，建议禁用预览窗格或使用受保护的视图功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-002"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1195","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1195.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1577","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer HHOpen ActiveX 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Internet Explorer 4.01 及 5 版本所安装的 HHOpen ActiveX 控件（hhopen.ocx 1.0.0.1）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向该控件的 OpenHelp 方法传递超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，从而在用户浏览器上下文中执行任意命令。攻击者需诱导用户访问恶意网页即可完成利用，无需其他认证条件。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.1,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1577"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:45Z","remediation":"升级至 Internet Explorer 5.5 及以上版本可消除该漏洞；若无法升级，可通过注册表为 hhopen.ocx 设置 kill bit（CLSID: {ADB880A2-D8FF-11CF-9377-00AA003B7A11}），在 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\ActiveX Compatibility\\{ADB880A2-D8FF-11CF-9377-00AA003B7A11} 下创建 DWORD 值 Compatibility Flags 为 0x400，禁用该 ActiveX 控件。建议使用现代浏览器替代 IE 系列。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/29795","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/28719","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/669","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3314","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19521","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/aac9f724534c8b70ef764b55a2e686a2db6290f7/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1577.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1577","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1577.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2cd9d7030fbc42684ccfa32eb6cd959ffcadf351/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1577.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/26d7afd7aa97d50454756aec5636fa553464ffd2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hc2h-vv8g-pjcj/GHSA-hc2h-vv8g-pjcj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1577.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f14bb3bf-ccb1-4061-8ce5-1ea255ae4ec9.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/669/info.html","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--f14bb3bf-ccb1-4061-8ce5-1ea255ae4ec9.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1195.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-1195.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1195.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1008","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1008.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0873","title":"Sky Communications Skyfull 1.1.4 Mail Server MAIL FROM 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sky Communications Skyfull 1.1.4 邮件服务器在处理 MAIL FROM 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 SMTP 服务发送超长特制的 MAIL FROM 参数触发该漏洞，导致服务崩溃或任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Skyfull 1.1.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，无需身份认证即可远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0873"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-30T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"Sky Communications 已停止维护 Skyfull Mail Server，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即迁移至受支持的邮件服务器（如 Postfix 3.x 或 Exim 4.x），并在迁移完成前在边界防火墙上限制对 SMTP 25/TCP 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的内部 IP 连接，同时配置入侵检测系统监控异常 SMTP 命令流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19584","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0873.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0873","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0873.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0873.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8483-grf5-r2r3/GHSA-8483-grf5-r2r3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0873.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/759/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153600_153700.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1008.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1165","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1165.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1532","title":"Netscape Messaging Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netscape Messaging Server 3.54、3.55 及 3.6 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 SMTP 服务发送一系列超长 RCPT TO 命令，消耗目标系统大量内存资源，导致服务响应缓慢或完全崩溃。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击者只需构造恶意 SMTP 会话即可触发，影响所有运行上述版本的邮件服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1532"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-29T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:38Z","remediation":"Netscape Messaging Server 已停止维护，官方无补丁可用。建议升级至受支持的邮件服务器软件（如 Exchange、Postfix 等）。若无法升级，在 SMTP 网关或防火墙限制单连接 RCPT TO 命令数量及单行长度（如限制 ≤512 字节），并配置入侵检测规则拦截包含超长 RCPT TO 命令的 SMTP 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94117465014255&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/748","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19571","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/148999c8327bd04fe7e0fdad6195adf7b36060c6/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1532.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1532","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-1999-1532.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/81cdfffcd86317dec05d7dfba407f93d96d91273/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1532.json","https://github.com/stg-tud/cveenhance/blob/6476e73d87cdc9cf610342ef15d131432ab41588/Annotations/Schmidt/CVE-1999-1532.xml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/9a3495eb833b3f1f2096187c4b14884afc98b67a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hhr5-xxj8-pvc5/GHSA-hhr5-xxj8-pvc5.json","https://github.com/dionmulaj/Boryoku/blob/2a1a981471c9b917512f28da1fa5c59c009329cd/cve-check/web/http_cve_check.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1532.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000839.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5da1d144-5ed3-431e-bae9-beec89545bf9.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1013","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1226","title":"Netscape Communicator 长证书密钥远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 4.7及更早版本在处理超长证书密钥时存在安全漏洞。远程攻击者可向用户发送包含恶意超长证书密钥的服务器响应，触发缓冲区溢出，导致目标系统拒绝服务，甚至可能执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Netscape Communicator 系列浏览器，属拒绝服务漏洞，CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1226"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:59Z","remediation":"该漏洞影响已停止支持的 Netscape Communicator 4.7 及更早版本。建议立即停止使用该软件，升级至仍受支持的现代浏览器（如 Firefox、Chrome、Edge），避免因未修复的证书解析漏洞导致拒绝服务或任意代码执行。如暂时无法升级，可在网络层面配置深度包检测（DPI）过滤异常长度的证书链流量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securiteam.com/exploits/Netscape_4_7_and_earlier_vulnerable_to__Huge_Key__DoS.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3436","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d3dea9b9f675980a583148876f0551475ad122e1/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1226.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1226","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1226.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3f415771bcfb63723b9c0d3f106f197a1964d0e2/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1226.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9jww-v5c9-f3ff/GHSA-9jww-v5c9-f3ff.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/39f1db26eec9899ab2f8110ab3b45424c6fe9ec2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1226.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87546/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5cbad00d-e7aa-4d06-80c2-ba642bb0f45c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0713","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0713.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0915","title":"Pacific Software URL Live! 1.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Pacific Software URL Live! 1.0 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的恶意 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 URL Live! 1.0 版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0915"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:19Z","remediation":"该漏洞存在于已停止维护的 Pacific Software URL Live! 1.0 中，厂商已不再提供安全更新。建议立即迁移至受支持的 Web 服务器（如 Apache HTTP Server 2.4.x 或 Nginx 最新稳定版）。如无法迁移，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则拦截包含 `../` 或 `..\\` 的 URL 请求路径，并禁用目录列表功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1129","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/746","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94380d498cb52b65d051c9bd443b6f2aa85bf8ec/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0915.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0915","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0915.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cdbbe57bd34c799f670485304ef54912650bf03b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0915.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bf2339193e1c10dc2db330718adeb8cc8d88c4dd/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6c27-6r97-2xgw/GHSA-6c27-6r97-2xgw.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0915.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/542ccf7ca1980a320a4dc1c4f0821b498d3bc23b/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0713.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0673","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0673.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0882","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1664,\"inputTokens\":9113,\"outputTokens\":18,\"totalTokens\":10795}}","description":"Falcon Web 服务器在处理文件名请求时存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向服务器请求一个超长文件名的资源（例如超过系统路径长度限制的 URL），服务器在返回错误响应时会将 Web 根目录的绝对路径一同暴露出来。该漏洞影响运行 Falcon Web 服务器的系统，攻击条件为攻击者能够网络访问目标 Web 服务并发送构造的超长文件名请求。利用方式简单，通过普通 HTTP 请求即可触发，攻击者借此可获取服务器文件系统目录结构信息，为后续进一步攻击提供路径情报，CVSS 评分约为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0882"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-28T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:15Z","remediation":"建议将 Falcon Web Server 升级到修复了 CVE-1999-0882 的最新版本，或替换为持续维护的 Web 服务器（如 Apache 或 Nginx）以彻底消除风险。临时缓解措施：在 Falcon 配置文件中启用自定义错误页面，将 404、403 等错误响应中的服务器绝对路径信息替换为通用提示文本，避免向攻击者泄露 Web 根目录路径。同时，在服务器前端部署 WAF 规则，拦截包含超长文件名的异常请求，阻断路径探测攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0882","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/edbb10deb36e9400fcd245fdb6d1781b6f0ae700/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0882.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0882","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0882.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/af2c3b5adc3ff9dc412f664a188835d908ce9d5f/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0882.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-ww4w-m2mr-8x97/GHSA-ww4w-m2mr-8x97.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0882.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88397/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000836.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5c8580dc-f42b-479f-817d-d00539e4cba0.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0673.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1408","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1408.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0950","title":"Texas Imperial Software WFTPD FTP服务器 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"WFTPD FTP服务器在处理MKD（创建目录）和CWD（切换目录）命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标FTP服务器发送特制的MKD和CWD命令序列创建深层嵌套目录，可触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致以root权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响WFTPD 2.34/2.40/3.0版本，CVSS v2评分10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0950"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1999-10-28T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-11-20T00:00:00Z","remediation":"WFTPD已停止维护多年，官方不再提供安全更新。建议立即将FTP服务迁移至仍在维护的FTP服务器软件（如vsftpd、ProFTPD或FileZilla Server），并配置防火墙限制FTP服务仅对可信网络开放，同时禁用匿名登录和危险FTP命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/747","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0950","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19570"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19570"],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1408.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1017","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1234","title":"Microsoft Windows NT 4.0 LSA lsass.exe 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Windows NT 4.0 本地安全认证子系统服务 (LSASS.EXE) 存在空指针解引用漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 SamrOpenDomain、SamrEnumDomainUsers 及 SamrQueryDomainInfo 等 RPC 调用传递空策略句柄，导致 LSASS 进程崩溃，引发目标系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0 全版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。微软尚未发布官方补丁，建议通过防火墙限制对 RPC 端口的访问以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1234"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:00Z","remediation":"该漏洞源于 LSASS.EXE 在处理 MSRPC 请求时未正确校验空策略句柄所致。Microsoft 在 Windows NT 4.0 生命周期内未发布专门修复此问题的安全更新（SP3/SP4/SP5 及 LSA3-fix 均无效）。建议采取以下措施：(1) 在边界防火墙上阻止对 TCP 135/139/445 和 UDP 137/138/445 端口的入站访问，限制匿名 RPC 调用；(2) 通过本地安全策略将\"网络访问：允许匿名 SID/名称转换\"设置为\"已禁用\"；(3) Windows NT 4.0 已于 2004 年终止支持，建议升级至受支持的 Windows 版本（如 Windows Server 2019 或更高版本）以获取持续安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=ntbugtraq&m=94096671308565&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3293","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b4f1378756fd26f414d09a97dc81126672830951/1999/CVE-1999-1234.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1234.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1234","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1234.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-1234.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mv63-92x5-p264/GHSA-mv63-92x5-p264.json","https://github.com/uyuni-project/uyuni/blob/98947f5d37413b2879f9f7fc7f4f572dee76789e/testsuite/features/secondary/min_cve_id_new_syntax.feature","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1234.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x88000/87560/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0922","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0922.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1076","title":"Apple MacOS 9 空闲锁定安全绕过漏洞","description":"MacOS 9 的空闲锁定功能存在安全绕过漏洞。本地攻击者可通过以下步骤绕过已锁定会话的密码保护：在锁定状态下选择\"注销\"选项，当系统弹出应用程序确认对话框时选择\"取消\"按钮，即可直接返回被锁定的会话界面，从而获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞影响 MacOS 9 系统，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1076"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1999-10-26T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:40Z","remediation":"Mac OS 9 已停止技术支持，Apple 未发布官方补丁。建议禁用系统内置空闲锁定功能，改用第三方屏幕锁定软件（如 MacBouncer Plus）替代；同时加强物理访问控制，限制本地用户接触终端，并考虑升级到受支持的 macOS 版本以获取完整安全功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=94096348604173&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/745","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e17eb087fb437c23db93be0dd8d10804be51087/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1076.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1076","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-1076.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1eab609178bfac1fdc1fdc37b8b4d17d9ecf98b7/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1076.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/799c403529fad0f67d5473eea397e9968232a5ec/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-54c2-phxc-2hgx/GHSA-54c2-phxc-2hgx.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/745/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1076.json","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_bypass.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/ec3be0baed1eb129c466b944014a0769e187fd54/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0922.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0702","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0702.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0903","title":"AIX数据包过滤模块genfilt存在安全漏洞，无法正确过滤目标端口大于32767的流量","description":"AIX操作系统的数据包过滤模块中的genfilt功能存在安全漏洞。当目标端口号大于32767时，genfilt无法正确过滤网络流量，导致本应被阻止的流量能够绕过过滤规则。攻击者可利用此漏洞绕过防火墙策略，访问受保护的网络服务，造成信息泄露或系统被进一步利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0903"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-10-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"1999-10-26T00:00:00Z","remediation":"IBM已发布相关安全公告，建议用户升级AIX系统到包含修复的版本，或应用IBM官方提供的补丁程序。同时可通过配置额外的防火墙规则对大于32767端口的流量进行二次过滤，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T23:19:29Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0903"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0702.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0672","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0672.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0881","title":"Falcon Web Server 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Falcon Web Server 在处理请求路径时未正确校验目录遍历序列，远程攻击者可通过在 URL 中注入“../”等点点路径穿越组件，绕过文档根目录限制读取服务器上任意文件。攻击无需身份认证，在网络可达且服务对外提供 Web 访问时即可实施，可能导致配置文件、凭据或敏感业务数据泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0881"],"sources":["epss","nvd","cve"],"published":"1999-10-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"停用或替换存在缺陷的 Falcon Web Server；若必须继续使用，应在前置反向代理或 Web 应用防火墙中拦截含“../”的路径穿越请求，限制进程用户权限与可读目录范围，并尽快迁移至已修复路径规范化的替代 Web 服务。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T20:04:26Z","references":["https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-1999-0881","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/743","http://www.osvdb.org/1127"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0672.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1111","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0883","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9046,\"outputTokens\":17,\"totalTokens\":10791}}","description":"Zeus Web Server 的搜索功能存在任意文件读取漏洞。该服务允许用户通过搜索引擎接口传入文件名参数，但未对用户输入的文件路径进行合法性校验与访问限制，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制请求，将任意文件（如配置文件、密码文件等敏感内容）的路径作为搜索选项提交给服务器，从而越权读取目标系统上的任意文件内容。此漏洞影响运行 Zeus Web Server 的受影响版本，攻击仅需通过网络向目标服务器发送恶意 HTTP 请求即可触发，无需登录凭据，危害性高，可导致服务器敏感信息泄露。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0883"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-25T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:15Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Zeus Web Server 3.3d 或更高版本以修复该任意文件读取漏洞，相关补丁详情可参考 Zeus Technology 官方安全公告 (http://www.zeus.com/products/ws/advisories)。如无法立即升级，可在 Zeus 配置文件 zeus.conf 中禁用搜索引擎功能，将 SearchEngine 指令设置为 off 并重启服务；同时在防火墙或反向代理层限制对搜索引擎相关 URL 路径的访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问管理端口，防止外部攻击者利用搜索选项读取服务器敏感文件。对于已停更的 Zeus Web Server，建议迁移至现代 Web 服务器（如 Nginx 或 Apache）以彻底消除风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1126","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/742","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3380","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5546763f2cbf8b9d0a5bd1b009f21d50c3edeb8b/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0883.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0883","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/5cf8ba64f356efe9269b21eca2f657231acd746c/content/CVE-1999-0883.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aeda8c7b429aa1dfdb16de3b1ae154a7b870f9be/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0883.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5w39-4f7v-wh5j/GHSA-5w39-4f7v-wh5j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0883.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--8382c78b-1155-4737-bda3-8049e968e839.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000832.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/9f009125ab2c1b8dfc814bc96f504812b3f7d59f/1999.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1406","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1406.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0944","title":"IBM WebSphere ikeyman 弱加密密码漏洞","description":"IBM WebSphere 2.0 和 3.0 版本中的 ikeyman 工具使用弱加密算法存储 SSL 连接密钥数据库的密码，攻击者可通过分析加密后的密码文件，利用弱加密的脆弱性还原出明文密码，从而获取密钥数据库的访问权限。该漏洞影响 IBM WebSphere 2.0 及 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。建议用户升级至不受影响的版本或采用强加密方式存储密钥数据库密码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0944"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-10-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:22Z","remediation":"升级到 IBM WebSphere 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已弃用 ikeyman 工具并改用更安全的密钥库管理方式。如无法升级，应避免使用 ikeyman 存储 SSL 密钥库密码，改用 keytool 等工具手动管理密钥库，并对密钥库文件设置严格的文件系统权限（仅允许管理员访问）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0944","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20274","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58316128f65d22a226717ff1f92ebf2058e46bc6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0944.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0944","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-0944.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4d2ed764072119c12b6f84e6ee4e0df62586a8c4/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0944.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/95e6ff620d5494b93ba2234edfcf6a45187dc0a8/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6mpp-2p9c-58q8/GHSA-6mpp-2p9c-58q8.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0944.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_153700_153800.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1763/info.html","https://github.com/security-commits/security-patches-dataset/blob/e93fcdcc8c9b91785f962a06d66b7ee623780245/data/cve-details/year/1999.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-1406.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1406.toml"}]